      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CYBTRAFFIC/status/2017554649545642285",
      "text": "🚦 CYBERABAD TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚴‍♀️\n\n🎗️A Cancer Awareness Women’s Bike Ride will be conducted in the Madhapur – Raidurgam – Gachibowli – Narsingi stretches from 06:00 AM to 09:00 AM on (01.02.2026)\n\nA large number of cyclists will be participating in this awareness initiative. \nMotorists may experience slow traffic movement along parts of the route during the event.\n\nAdvisory to Road Users:\n• Drive cautiously and stay alert near cyclists \n• Maintain safe distance and avoid sudden overtaking \n• Follow on-ground diversions and traffic police instructions \n• Plan your travel in advance \n\n⏳Let us support the cause while ensuring safety for everyone on the road.\n\nEarly detection saves lives. Road safety saves lives too. \n\n#TrafficAdvisory #CancerAwareness\n#WomenRideSafe #RoadSafety\n#CyberabadTrafficPolice",
